## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/baseline_baseline_reports_every_violation_when_count_is_exceeded'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "suspicious": { "noDebugger": "error", "noDoubleEquals": "warn" },
      "complexity": { "noUselessCatch": "error" }
    }
  }
}
```

## `a.js`

```js
debugger;
debugger;

```

## `biome-baseline.json`

```json
{ "a.js": { "lint/suspicious/noDebugger": { "count": 1 } } }
```

